+# AUTOS additions to engine-sim v0.1.11a
+
+Branch `autos-011a` = upstream tag v0.1.11a + AUTOS commits (MIT, Copyright 2022 AngeTheGreat).
+
+- `src/autos_render.cpp` -> `engine-sim-render`: headless offline renderer (float WAV, fixed leveler gain,
+  dyno hold / free idle / crank / start modes, dyno sweep, rpm trace). Used by AUTOS `bake.py`.
+- `engine-sim-app` patch: leveler pinned to a fixed gain; hold L + scroll to change it.
+- `Synthesizer::setFloatSink`: float tap before int16 clipping.
+
+## Build (Windows)
+
+VS 2022 Build Tools, CMake 4.x, vcpkg `boost-filesystem:x64-windows-static-md` and
